    "body": "Thank you for this PR, and welcome! The description and the tests look complete.\n\nOne small thing about this repository: a PR that is a **draft** is not reviewed, because it can still change. If the work is finished, please click **\"Ready for review\"** (at the bottom of the PR page). Our reviewer then starts within about an hour: it builds the PR against current `main`, runs the tests it touches, and posts the result here as a comment.\n\nIf you still want to change something first, that is fine too - mark it ready when you are done.\n",
